Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.17,0:15:44.17,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(188,1)\an7\c&HE5CFC9&\3c&H573824&\blur2\fs10\b0\pos(34.73,147.98)}Adaga adquirida do Monarca Demoníaco Baran. Ao usar ambas as\NAdagas do Monarca Demoníaco, o buff de conjunto será aplicado.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:38.83,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Sua velocidade é comparável à minha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:42.40,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Mesmo assim, ele está\Nficando mais rápido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.52,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Como isso é possível?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:43.87,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\bord1.5\p1)\c&H2E1219&\3a&H00&\1a&H60&\3c&HD58AAE&\pos(14.22,11.93)}m 0 0 l 270 0 270 80 0 80
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.50,0:17:43.87,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&HFEEDCD&\3c&H573824&\blur2\fs12\pos(25.73,37.86)}[Habilidade: Golpe Fatal] foi atualizado para\Nsua versão final, {\c&HB6FF35&\3c&H1B2D18&\i1}[Habilidade: Mutilação]{\i0\c&HFEEDCD&\3c&H573824&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:44.25,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an9\bord1.5\p1)\c&H2E1219&\3a&H00&\1a&H60&\3c&HD58AAE&\pos(627.55,19.05)}m 0 0 l 270 0 270 180 0 180
