Dialogue: 2,0:17:43.87,0:17:44.25,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\c&HA1FB1B&\3c&H2A2E1D&\blur2\fs14\pos(492.39,164.97)}Mutilação\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&HF8F9E1&\3c&H836E40&}Nv. Máx
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:48.42,Solo-Italics,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Upgrade... "Mutilação"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:54.78,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,O-O que é isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:00.83,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Como?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:06.40,Solo-Main,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Regeneração, é?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.59,0:18:09.08,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,O que é isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:13.67,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,O que foi que aconteceu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:41.95,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Quem é... esse humano?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:46.08,Solo-Main,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Esse humano!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.93,0:18:50.90,Solo-Main,Sung Jinwoo,0000,0000,0000,,Vão.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:16.61,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Como é possível?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:21.17,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Eu nasci para ser o mais forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:28.27,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Eu devoro tudo, e me torno\Ncada vez mais poderoso...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:32.43,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Era para eu ser o rei.\NAinda assim...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.24,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Fugir...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.74,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Eu preciso fugir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:43.41,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Para sobreviver... eu preciso fugir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.31,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Preciso ir o mais longe possível!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.77,0:20:10.06,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Rápido! Mais rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:12.12,Solo-Italics,Ant King,0000,0000,0000,,Preciso fugir e escapar daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.69,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\fs15\fnArial\c&HFBF3EB&\3c&HAE7169&\blur2\pos(162.33,142.11)}[Habilidade Ativa]
